{"id":"st381-5","designation":"ST 381-5","title":"MXF Mapping Streams into Generic Container — Mapping HEVC Streams into the MXF Generic Container","state":"active","suite":"381","official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/st381-5/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/st381-5/","checked_at":"2026-11-18"},"scope":"This standard specifies the mapping of all HEVC coding data as defined in ISO/IEC 23008-2 | Rec. ITU-T H.265 into the Material Exchange Format Generic Container (MXF-GC) based on the MXF MPEG mapping standard (SMPTE ST 381-2). This standard does not apply to Annexes G (MHEVC), H (SHEVC) or I (3DHEVC) of the HEVC standard. This standard also does not support the HEIF file format (ISO/IEC 23008-12). This document specifies the carriage of parameter sets in an HEVC essence stream “in-band”. The MXF specification is written in several parts. This is an MXF mapping specification that defines header metadata sets and values, essence container elements and index table applications.","outline":[{"level":1,"title":"Foreword","page":2},{"level":1,"title":"Intellectual Property","page":2},{"level":1,"title":"1 Scope","page":2},{"level":1,"title":"2 Conformance Notation","page":2},{"level":1,"title":"3 Normative References","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"4 Terms and Definitions","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.1 HEVC","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.2 NAL","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.3 I Picture","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.4 IDR Picture","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.5 CRA Picture","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.6 BLA Picture","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.7 P Picture","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.8 B Picture","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.9 Br Picture","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.10 GOP","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.11 Key Picture","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.12 parameter sets","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.13 in-band","page":5},{"level":1,"title":"5 Technical Introduction (Informative)","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"5.1 HEVC Coding Summary","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"5.2 Requirements of Mapping HEVC Streams into MXF","page":6},{"level":1,"title":"6 Mapping the HEVC Streams to the MXF Generic Container","page":6},{"level":1,"title":"7 Key-Length-Value Coding","page":7},{"level":2,"title":"7.1 Picture Element Key","page":7},{"level":2,"title":"7.2 Picture Element Length","page":7},{"level":2,"title":"7.3 Picture Element Value","page":7},{"level":1,"title":"8 SMPTE Label Values","page":8},{"level":2,"title":"8.1 Essence Container Label","page":8},{"level":2,"title":"8.2 Picture Essence Coding Label","page":9},{"level":1,"title":"9 Essence Descriptor for HEVC Mapping","page":12},{"level":2,"title":"9.1 HEVC Sub Descriptor","page":12},{"level":2,"title":"9.2 Key for the HEVC Sub Descriptor","page":16},{"level":1,"title":"10 Index Table for HEVC Mapping","page":17},{"level":1,"title":"Annex A HEVC Sub Descriptor Item for closed environments (normative)","page":19},{"level":1,"title":"Annex B HEVC Essence Container Label structure (informative)","page":20},{"level":1,"title":"Bibliography (informative)","page":21}],"definitions":[{"term":"I Picture","definition":"picture consisting only of I-Slices"},{"term":"IDR Picture","definition":"instantaneous decoding refresh picture as defined in ISO/IEC 23008-2 I Rec. ITU-T H.265"},{"term":"CRA Picture","definition":"clean random access picture as defined in ISO/IEC 23008-2 I Rec. ITU-T H.265"},{"term":"BLA Picture","definition":"broken link access picture as defined in ISO/IEC 23008-2 I Rec. ITU-T H.265"},{"term":"P Picture","definition":"picture consisting of P-Slices, or P-Slices and I-Slices"},{"term":"B Picture","definition":"picture consisting of B-Slices, or B-Slices and P-Slices, or B-Slices, P-Slices and I-Slices"},{"term":"Key Picture","definition":"earliest preceding I Picture required for decoding the indexed Picture"}],"keywords":[{"term":"Video Compression","zh":"视频压缩","abbr":"","category":"tv","source":"curated"},{"term":"Materia